WOW-BG3 benilla patch 0036: BG3's vertex-colour cuts on the figures (on top of 0001-0009, 0011-0035).

Bodies poked through the clothes (Gale's legs and chest through his robe,
Astarion's feet and shins through his boots, underwear through trousers), because BG3's own cuts were never
active in WoW. BG3's rule (from its shaders and its own textures at runtime):
- Every material whose shader has a VertexColor_MSK texture (CHAR_Skin_Body, the genitals' and pubes' shaders,
  CHAR_BASE_*VertCut* for underwear and clothes) moves, in its vertex shader, each vertex to its object's origin
  where step(0.01, VertexColor_MSK.g) at uv (fract(16 g), floor(16 g) / 16), g the vertex colour's G, point-wrap
  sampled (CHAR_BASE_VertCut_VT_ST_DEF_Vulkan.bshd): texel k for G byte k (255 wraps to 0).
- One 16x16 RGBA8 mask per character, bound to all its such draws (G-buffer and depth), texel k = 255 for the
  NakedBodySystem byte (Mods/Shared/EquipmentSettings/VisualSlots.lsx) of every VertexColorMaskSlots entry of its
  equipped visuals (ClientEquipmentVisuals), rewritten in place when the equipment changes. Layer tavlog + image
  dumps: Gale, Astarion, Shadowheart, Lae'zel, Wyll, Karlach all as the rule says; Astarion's boots unequipped
  dropped 150 (feet) and 20 (Pants), kept 36 (shins, from his pants), equipped again restored them.
Here (wowbg3_tav.rs): each skinned mesh keeps its vertex colour's G byte (stream 0 starts with the u8x4 colour
when uv0 is at offset 4; the layer already copies stream 0), link/tools/tavtex.py writes the figure's mask bytes
as tavtex.txt's `cut:<b>,...` token on the meshes whose material cuts, and the triangles whose three vertices
are cut are left out of the index buffer (exactly what BG3's collapse leaves without area; no triangle of the six
origins has only some vertices cut: such a one would be kept whole and logged). A mesh key keeps its cut across
plans until tavtex.txt gives the plan's own; an equipment change rebuilds the indices. WOW_BG3_TAV_CUTS=off: no
cuts. Supersedes the cut half of link/benilla/0010-wowbg3-tav-mips-cuts.patch (WIP, never applied).

